g-Unseen-300x225.png 300w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Koh-Sichang-Unseen-768x576.png 768w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Koh-Sichang-Unseen.png 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">โรงแรม  </span>Koh Sichang Unseen<span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #333333;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">แห่งนี้ได้รับคะแนนรีวิว  7.1/10 คะแนนจาก Agoda.com</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">เลือกเข้าพักได้   1-3  ท่าน</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ราคา เริ่มต้นห้องละ  1,052   บาท</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">จองโรงแรม ราคาพิเศษ</span></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=1194747\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1893 aligncenter\" src=\"http://topofhotel.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/agodacom.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\" /></span></a></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span></h6>\n<hr />\n<h4><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=1156500\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">7.) Moroc Home Resort Koh Sichang</a></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=1156500\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3526 aligncenter\" src=\"https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Moroc-Home-Resort-Koh-Sichang-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"601\" height=\"451\" srcset=\"https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Moroc-Home-Resort-Koh-Sichang-300x225.jpg